				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5277</guid>
				<title>SCP-5277</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5277</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #: SCP-5277&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5277 Is to be granted a mid-sized [23ft by 23ft] room, within site ██. Any requests made by SCP-5277 are to be granted, limited to requests to leave, or material possessions that are not necessities. SCP-5277 is also allowed to request two books, from any author it wishes. Any requests to leave made by SCP-5277 are to be reviewed by site director ██████, If approved, two armed facility guards will accompany SCP-5277 to the location it visits, limited to site ██.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5277, appears as a boy, most commonly dressed in a Victorian style vest, and black pants, he carries a small teddy bear, and wears a beaked white mask. SCP-5277 is roughly 13 years of age. When prompted to remove it, SCP-5277 refused, but after a while of negotiating, SCP-5277 finally agreed, in return SCP-5277 asked for permission to request two books. Researchers noted the oddity within his eyes. SCP-5277’s eyes are a dark red color, with multiple black swirls filling the center pupil of each eye.&lt;br /&gt;
When questioned about his name, SCP-5277 told the researcher to call him Damien Drackley, or Damien for short.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5277’s left hand has a large scale rune, and seems to be carved by hand into its left palm, its right palm seems to have a smaller scaled different rune, burnt into it. Multiple various runes, of smaller size are scattered throughout his body, and many lashes and bruises can also be observed. When questioned about them, Damien seemed to day dream, or ponder for a moment, moments later SCP-5277 began to explain about his family uprising, and how he grew up in a cult, rather than a home. He described how his father would often torment his mother, his siblings, but mostly SCP-5277 himself. Recent research into SCP-5277 reveals his story is not false, and he did infact grow up in a cult setting, a small scale cult in the north of america, named the Drackley Cult, in 1995 after 3 years of existing, the town it was settled in rioted against the house for reasons unknown, burning down the estate completely, when SCP-5277 was questioned about this he refused to respond, and showed slight signs of distress and trauma.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5277 seems to talk to himself frequently, this and other odd events, such as SCP-5277 producing a small unbranded juice box, and his cult uprising, makes Researcher ██████ believe due to his cult uprising SCP-5277 has some form of entity residing within SCP-5277, SCP-5277’s anomalous properties are currently partly unknown, due to the fact that communication with the entity residing inside SCP-5277, or SCP-5277-1 is extremely difficult, especially if it does not want to converse. SCP-5277 seems to have partly an understanding of how and why he is being possessed, but refuses to explain in depth. SCP-5277 explains that he and SCP-5277-1 can communicate, and that they do regularly. SCP-5277 also explains that SCP-5277-1 describes themselves as a reality bending anomaly, which has latched onto SCP-5277 through the cult practices his family did to himself. Multiple events since then have led the foundation to believe SCP-5277-1 is attempting to protect SCP-5277, through various means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Researcher ██████ requested the study of SCP-5277&#039;s Hume readings, which was approved by site director ██████. When SCP-5277&#039;s Humes were studied, multiple results [approximately 3] were discovered. The first, presumed to be SCP-5277 himself, was a base of 1. The second result, presumed to be the entity within SCP-5277 was an astronomically large number. The third result, unknown as to what it could be, was impossible to deduct, and further research into this is in the works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Researcher ██████ recorded an instance of his conversation with SCP-5277, regarding his family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher ██████ wanted to further inquire upon SCP-5277&#039;s family life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log.&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5277 can he heard taking a seat, and begins talking immediately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5277:&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher, why have you called me here, what do we have to discuss?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;██████:&lt;/strong&gt; 5277-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5277 quickly interrupts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP 5277:&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher, at least have the curtsy to call me by my name, not my number.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*██████:** Damien, I have called you here to discuss your family, specifically your father and his treatments of you, and your siblings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5277 shows audible discomfort, and sighs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP 5277:&lt;/strong&gt; What about him? I believe I have made myself clear that he wasn&#039;t a very good person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*██████:** Well, did he know anything about.. Well, about 5277-1?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5277 is quiet, for a long minute, before he resumed talking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP 5277:&lt;/strong&gt; I remember how he constantly referred to me by this weird name, I believe it was, &amp;quot;The Red Eyed Apostle&amp;quot;, I thought of it as silly, I always thought he was completely insane. When I would ask him about what we were worshiping, he would always allude that I was part of it, it made me so confused in the moment. Other than that, nothing I can really recall.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*██████:** Alright, lets move onto your mother.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP 5277:&lt;/strong&gt; My mother commonly showed great affection and remorse to me and my siblings, and I think she was trying to stop my father, but failed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*██████:** Is that all?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP 5277:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes, I&#039;m sorry if I cannot provide that much information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Its fine, Damien.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log.&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; After the interview, Damien seemed to be much more emotional for the rest of the day, and slept within his cell for most of the day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
