 with political violence, infectious disease and locust famines being significantly reduced from 1 year prior.</p> <p><strong>Addendum-4:</strong></p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">note</span></p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Note</span></p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Autocorrect stop</span></p> <p>Do not trust the NSA’s point-bearer and the doctor assigned to overview, they/them are suspected to be SCP-5134-8/9.</p> <p>Sometimes it feels like autocorrect is writing for user.</p> <p><strong>Addendum-5:</strong></p> <p>Investigate the degree that curiosity about SCP-5134 and risk vector for further affection could result from inversely contemplating SCP-5134 by way of [redacted] of data about the recession of SCP-5134 in the wake of containment.</p> <p><strong>Addendum-6:</strong> [Update: 15-__-2021]</p> <p>SCP-5134-8 has been terminated, the point-personnel for our partnership with the NSA have been replaced as a precaution. Human Resources is currently recruiting a replacement Lead Researcher.</p> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5133">SCP-5133</a> | SCP-5134 | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5135">SCP-5135</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duganist" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7085155&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606942288" alt="Duganist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7085155)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duganist" >Duganist</a></span></p> 
