&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;begin log 2:03 am&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-336:&lt;/strong&gt; Man, garfield duty is boring&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-██:&lt;/strong&gt; Yeah it is. Hey, what&#039;s that sound?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Screech is heard on log then something shattering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-██:&lt;/strong&gt; HOT ███ IT BROKE RIGHT THROUGH THE WA-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunches heard on log&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-336:&lt;/strong&gt; OH ███ IT GOT DAN! REQUESTING BACKUP!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;radio static heard&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-██:&lt;/strong&gt; On it, what breached?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-336:&lt;/strong&gt; THE MOTHER███ING GARFIELD!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-██:&lt;/strong&gt; Oh you&#039;re kidding me&amp;#8230; I need a RRT squadron. Garf- [inaudible] -peat Garfield is breached.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-██:&lt;/strong&gt; 336, switch to channel 3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-336:&lt;/strong&gt; Copy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Will:&lt;/strong&gt; This is researcher will, does anybody copy?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-336:&lt;/strong&gt; I copy, what is it?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Will:&lt;/strong&gt; Oh ██ its right there&amp;#8230; Help me please its almost here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-336:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain your position. We have a squadron coming.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Weird liquid sounds are heard&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RRT-██:&lt;/strong&gt; We layed down the lasagna. Maintaining posi- MOTHER OF ███ THAT THING IS FAST!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RRT-██:&lt;/strong&gt; RUN!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-336:&lt;/strong&gt; Drop lasagna into its cage!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RRT-███&lt;/strong&gt; I got some in! Door controls stand by!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher rick:&lt;/strong&gt; Standing by. Yes! It took the bait! Closing doors now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-336:&lt;/strong&gt; Hey will, you can come out now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5 seconds pass&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-336:&lt;/strong&gt; Will?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;end of log 2:46 am&amp;gt;&lt;br /&gt;
[[/tab]]&lt;br /&gt;
[[tab SCP-008 (infection)]]&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;begin log 4:23 am&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RRT-██:&lt;/strong&gt; Alright guys, the person who breached this thing may be listening. We will refer to ourselves as our code names now, remember im alpha A3. Got it?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes sir!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes sir!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bravo-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes sir!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bravo-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes sir!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes sir!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5 seconds pass&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A3:&lt;/strong&gt; Alpha-A2, I said do you understand?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;10 Seconds pass&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A3:&lt;/strong&gt; Alpha-A2?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everyone is quiet for 1 minute&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Suddenly faint screams are heard on Alpha-A2&#039;s end&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A3:&lt;/strong&gt; Alpha-A2? Do you copy?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heavy breathing is heard on the log. Its getting louder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gunshots are heard on log&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; Phew&amp;#8230; I got those ███&#039;s.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; A2? What just happened?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; Oh ███ man&amp;#8230; There were these, these things&amp;#8230; They were so distorted and- oh gosh&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Where are you? You must be close since you&#039;re in our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; Lemme see if there&#039;s any signs&amp;#8230; I&#039;m by wing 3&amp;#8230; In the researcher section&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher section in wing 3? Hey man&amp;#8230; Isn&#039;t that like ground zero?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; Wait&amp;#8230; what?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bravo-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; That means GET THE ███ OUT OF THERE NOW!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; I&#039;m headed into the CDC! Its the closest place!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; That doesn&#039;t seem like the wisest decision&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; Wait&amp;#8230; Did I literally just say the CDC? Oh ███ thats a horde&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Running is heard on log&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; THATS A LOT! THAT IS A LOT OF EM!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gunshots are heard&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; THEYRE JUST GETTING BACK UP!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Oh my gosh man&amp;#8230; Its common sense. Aim for the ███ing head, or aim for the legs. It&#039;ll either kill em, or disable em.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Wait, I see one&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A3:&lt;/strong&gt; I see it too&amp;#8230; Its just one though. Fire at will&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gunshots are heard&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Hah easy, let&#039;s go check out the body.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A3:&lt;/strong&gt; Are you that stu-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; GAAAUGH MY LEGS! AAUUGHHH! AAAAUuuaaughuhhh&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A3:&lt;/strong&gt; OH MY ███!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Screaming and gunshots heard&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5 seconds pass&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bravo-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Alpha-A1 and A3? Do you copy?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bravo-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; ███ IT! THAT WAS MY BROTHER!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bravo-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Oh gosh I&#039;m so sorry dude&amp;#8230; Hey do you hear something?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bravo-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Is that Alpha-A2?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; THERES A HORDE! GET OUT!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; A horde?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bravo-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; YES ITS A HORDE! GET OUT OF THERE CHAR-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Static is heard&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;10 seconds pass&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Bravo? Team bravo? Do you copy?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; A1, let&#039;s go. Were getting out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; O- ok&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Five minutes pass&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; Wait&amp;#8230; Is that a survivor?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;???:&lt;/strong&gt; *whispers* Shut the ███ up!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gun cocking is heard&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify yourself&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;???:&lt;/strong&gt; *Whispers* I said shut up! I&#039;m MTF-336&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; *Whispers* I thought the Bravo team just died&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-336:&lt;/strong&gt; *whispers* I&#039;m not the bravo team! I was recovering in the medbay after the Garfield incident, and an alarm goes off. Some people run in, and barricade the doors. Theyre- they&#039;re all dead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A2:&lt;/strong&gt; *Whispers* dang man. Wait.. Whats that?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shuffling heard on log&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charlie-A1:&lt;/strong&gt; Oh no.. Oh nonono thats the bravo team AND the alpha team&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF-336:&lt;/strong&gt; RUN!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gunshots are heard and screaming and running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;DATA LOST&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;End of log 5:16 am&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
