/p> <p>&lt;End of log 5:16 am&gt;</p> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a class="newpage" href="/">-----</a> | Zombie | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/duccy-hub:Darkest-days">Darkest days</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7059423&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606942288" alt="Duccy boi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7059423)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi" >Duccy boi</a></span></p> 
